    "text": "[S89][[A90]CX[/A90]][/S89] [IMG91]\nThe [I92]sig[/I92] argument is not a valid signal number or an attempt is made to catch a signal that cannot be caught or ignore a\nsignal that cannot be ignored. [IMG93]",
