    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Moved from X/OPEN UNIX extension to BASE.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00045",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The DESCRIPTION is updated to indicate that the [I129]sigpause[/I129]() function restores the signal mask of the process to its\noriginal state before returning.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I129": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00046",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The RETURN VALUE section is updated to indicate that the [I130]sigpause[/I130]() function suspends execution of the process until a\nsignal is received, whereupon it returns -1 and sets [I131]errno[/I131] to [EINTR].",
    "placeholders": {
     "I130": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I131": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00047",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     63
    ],
    "text": "[A132][/A132]Issue 6",
    "placeholders": {
     "A132": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_552_13\" id=\"tag_17_552_13\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00048",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Extensions beyond the ISO&nbsp;C standard are marked.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00049",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The normative text is updated to avoid use of the term &quot;must&quot; for application requirements.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00050",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The DESCRIPTION is updated for alignment with the ISO/IEC&nbsp;9899:1999 standard.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00051",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     7
    ],
    "text": "References to the [I133]wait3[/I133]() function are removed.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I133": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00052",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     9
    ],
    "text": "The [I134]sighold[/I134](), [I135]sigignore[/I135](), [I136]sigrelse[/I136](), and [I137]sigset[/I137]() functions are split out onto their own\nreference page.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I134": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I135": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I136": {
